# Core design

When changing visual UI under `apps/web`, read `DESIGN.md` and follow `.cursor/skills/core-design/SKILL.md`.

- Ledger paper, ink, one forest action, harvest only for the withheld name and the live-execution STOP.
- Map colors onto existing Tailwind keys. Do not add a new accent in a component.
- Leave the public dark shell alone while Visual Polish v1 is blocked (`docs/PRODUCT-REVIEW-V1.md`).
- Do not apply this look to `fieldlot/` or `styles/agri-market-*.css`.
